    @ref Qore::PO_NO_INHERIT_SYSTEM_CONSTANTS, and @ref Qore::PO_NO_INHERIT_SYSTEM_CLASSES

    This method also merges the builtin feature / module list from the source calling context as well

    @throw IMPORT-SYSTEM-API-ERROR objects already imported; parse options are locked on the Program object;
    conflicting object found; system API incorrectly imported; in case this exception is raised, the Program object
